WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.752
Ba’zi tenglamalar o‘zgaruvchan koeffitsiyentli va ularning yechimi elementar funksiyalar bilan yozilmaydi.

2
00:00:07.752 --> 00:00:11.409
Masalan, Eyri tenglamasi y ikki shtrix teng iks y.

3
00:00:11.409 --> 00:00:19.892
Bunday hollarda yechimni cheksiz darajali qator ko‘rinishida izlaymiz va koeffitsiyentlarni birin-ketin hisoblaymiz.

4
00:00:19.892 --> 00:00:22.598
Bu kompyuterda ham oson dasturlanadi.

5
00:00:22.848 --> 00:00:28.932
Tenglamani y ikki shtrix plyus p y shtrix plyus q y teng nol ko‘rinishida yozamiz.

6
00:00:28.932 --> 00:00:34.498
Agar p va q nuqta iks nolda analitik bo‘lsa, bu nuqta oddiy nuqta deyiladi.

7
00:00:34.498 --> 00:00:40.285
Shunda har bir yechim qatorga yoyiladi, birinchi ikki koeffitsiyent ixtiyoriy,

8
00:00:40.285 --> 00:00:43.550
qolganlari rekurrent formula bilan topiladi.

9
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.686
Eyri tenglamasini olamiz.

10
00:00:45.686 --> 00:00:58.358
Qatorni ikki marta differensiallaymiz va indeksni ikkiga siljitamiz: y ikki shtrix teng yig‘indi n plyus ikki marta n plyus bir marta a n plyus ikki marta iks daraja n.

11
00:00:58.358 --> 00:01:05.222
O‘ng tomonda iks y, ya’ni yig‘indi a n minus bir iks daraja n, bu n teng birdan boshlanadi.

12
00:01:05.472 --> 00:01:12.480
Iks daraja nol oldidagi koeffitsiyentlarni tenglashtiramiz: ikki a ikki teng nol, demak a ikki nol.

13
00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:21.753
n birdan katta yoki teng bo‘lganda rekurrent formula: a n plyus ikki teng a n minus bir bo‘lingan n plyus ikki marta n plyus birga.

14
00:01:21.753 --> 00:01:25.646
Qadam uchga teng: koeffitsiyentlar uchtadan bog‘langan.

15
00:01:25.896 --> 00:01:32.017
Hisoblaymiz: a uch teng a nol bo‘lingan oltiga, a olti teng a nol bo‘lingan bir yuz saksonga.

16
00:01:32.017 --> 00:01:37.744
a to‘rt teng a bir bo‘lingan o‘n ikkiga, a yetti teng a bir bo‘lingan besh yuz to‘rtga.

17
00:01:37.744 --> 00:01:42.878
Ikki qator fundamental sistemani beradi va ular butun son o‘qida yaqinlashadi.

18
00:01:43.128 --> 00:01:52.718
Grafikda a nol bir, a bir nol bo‘lgan yechimning qisman yig‘indisi ko‘rsatilgan, iks daraja o‘n ikkigacha.

19
00:01:52.718 --> 00:02:01.765
Manfiy iks da yechim tebranadi, chunki u yerda tenglama y ikki shtrix plyus musbat son marta y kabi.

20
00:02:01.765 --> 00:02:05.022
Musbat iks da esa yechim tez o‘sadi.

21
00:02:05.022 --> 00:02:07.646
Bitta tenglama ikki xil xulq.

22
00:02:07.896 --> 00:02:14.618
Savol: y ikki shtrix minus iks y shtrix minus y teng nol tenglamaning rekurrent formulasi qanday?

23
00:02:14.618 --> 00:02:19.885
Hosilalarni qatorga qo‘ying va iks daraja n oldidagi koeffitsiyentni yozing.

24
00:02:19.885 --> 00:02:22.310
Videoni to‘xtatib, javobni tanlang.
